### Admin audit logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{oldRefreshToken}}"
}

### Old refresh token must fail after rotation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{oldRefreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logged-out refresh token must fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout from all devices
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Session 1 must now fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "MwMoZevg_MpS4SU9n3hY-u8G3IC55AmNTsPbqCOkoIPDcEjdY8uPJkhOSvBkl3sr"
}

